Z||000003||Boodoggin||05-26-2000||08:36 PM||||Frank- Hey I live in Idaho too!!  I live in Eagle between Boise and Nampa.  There are some great fiero guys around here.  There are ferrari kit cars and everything.  Also the fiero doctor Jay Rightnower lives by me and can do absolutley any thing with a fiero.  Here is the address for the SOUTHWEST IDAHO FIERO CLUB<A HREF="http://www.realvision-inc.com/fiero/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.realvision-inc.com/fiero/</A>  im not a member yet, but I see them around. Are you still looking for parts?  Email me, I might be able to help you find some. <p>[This message has been edited by Boodoggin (edited 05-26-2000).]||||reg||10
